WEBVTT

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Sarah (Interviewer): Thanks for jumping on, Marcus. Can you walk me through what happens when your reconciliation fails?

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Marcus (Head of Finance): Every single Monday we waste 2 hours manually downloading CSVs from Stripe because the webhooks time out silently.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Sarah (Interviewer): What do you do when a discrepancy pops up?

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Marcus (Head of Finance): We ping three engineers on Slack. Our customers get duplicate overdue notices. I would pay $500 a month for an alert before invoices go out.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:05.000
Marcus (Head of Finance): Compliance requires an audit trail for every manual adjustment. Right now people just edit Google Sheets.
